:: Hallways students xchange rumours3
<<effects>>
"Well, kinda, yeah..." the <<person>> shrugs. "I mean... I was told you need some pretty sharp eyes just to spot them among all those trees. But I was assured I'd recognise them by their shady coat, whatever that means."
<br><br>
"Shouldn't I go with you?" the friend offers. "You know. Just to be safe..."
<br><br>
"Yeah, no thanks. I don't wanna risk spooking them and screwing up my chances," the <<person>> refuses emphatically. "But hey, do you know what you could <i>actually</i> help me with?"
<br><br>
"Sex?" the friend replies clearly hopeful, but almost rhetorical.
<br><br>
"Sex. Yeah," the <<person1>><<persons>> drops the heaviest of sighs, betraying an obvious sense of defeat. "Come on. We still have some time left." 
