:: Hallways Fallen Mellow Reflection
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
<<case "meek">>
	You want to say something to break the silence, but the words die in your throat.
	You settle for staring at the floor until the hallway empties around you.
<<case "shy">>
	You want to say something to break the silence, but you can't make yourself look up.
	You settle for staring at the floor until the hallway empties around you.
<<case "polite">>
	You nod politely to the nearest students, but no one nods back.
	You keep your hands folded in front of you until the hallway empties around you.
<<case "confident">>
	You lift your chin and keep walking at your usual pace, refusing to let it show how much the quiet unsettles you.
<<case "bratty">>
	"What?! Have any problem with me?" you snap.
	No one says anything. They just keep their distance, and somehow the silence hurts more than any insult could.
<<case "docile">>
	You want to ask what you did wrong, but you only lower your head and let them keep their distance.
	You stay where you are until the hallway empties around you.
<<case "flamboyant">>
	You give the nearest students a bright smile, but no one returns it.
	You keep your head up until the hallway empties around you.
<<case "cruel">>
	"Fine, stay away," you say flatly. "I don't need any of you."
	No one answers. They keep their distance, and somehow the silence hurts more than any insult could.
<<default>>
	You force your shoulders back and keep walking, refusing to let it show how much the quiet unsettles you.
<</switch>>
<br><br>
Saint or sinner, you're neither anymore, and everyone can apparently tell.<<trauma 5>><<gtrauma>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

