:: School Changing Room Trans Explain
<<set $outside to 0>><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<set _transRoomGender to playerPronoun()>>
<<set _transIdentityGender to _transRoomGender>>
<<if !["m", "f"].includes(_transRoomGender)>>
	<<set _transRoomGender to $player.gender_appearance>>
<</if>>
<<set _roomGender to $changingRoomGender is "boys" ? "m" : "f">>

<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
<<case "meek">>
	"I-I'm trans," you explain. "I'm not trying to sneak in. This is the changing room I belong in."
<<case "shy">>
	"I-I'm trans," you explain, not quite looking at anyone. "I'm not trying to sneak in. This is the changing room I belong in."
<<case "polite">>
	"I'm transgender," you explain politely. "I'm not trying to cause trouble. This is the changing room I belong in."
<<case "confident">>
	<<if ["m", "f"].includes(_transIdentityGender)>>"I'm transgender," you say. "I'm a <<= _transIdentityGender is "m" ? "boy" : "girl">>, and this is where I belong."<<else>>"I'm transgender," you say. "I don't fit neatly into either category, and this is the room I'm most comfortable using."<</if>>
<<case "bratty">>
	<<if ["m", "f"].includes(_transIdentityGender)>>"I'm trans, idiot. I'm a <<= _transIdentityGender is "m" ? "boy" : "girl">>, and this is where I belong."<<else>>"I'm trans, idiot. I don't fit neatly into either box, but this is the room I'm comfortable using."<</if>>
<<case "docile">>
	"I-I'm trans," you explain softly. "I only want to get changed. This is the room I'm supposed to use."
<<case "flamboyant">>
	"I'm transgender," you say with a polite smile. "I'm not here to cause trouble. This is the changing room I belong in."
<<case "cruel">>
	<<if ["m", "f"].includes(_transIdentityGender)>>"I'm trans," you say coldly. "I'm a <<= _transIdentityGender is "m" ? "boy" : "girl">>, and I belong in here. Try throwing me out and see what happens."<<else>>"I'm trans," you say coldly. "I don't fit neatly into either box, and this is the room I'm using. Try throwing me out and see what happens."<</if>>
<<default>>
	<<if ["m", "f"].includes(_transIdentityGender)>>"I'm transgender," you say. "I'm a <<= _transIdentityGender is "m" ? "boy" : "girl">>. I'm here to change, same as you."<<else>>"I'm transgender," you say. "I don't fit neatly into either category, but this is the room I'm most comfortable using. I'm here to change, same as you."<</if>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<if _transRoomGender is _roomGender>>
	A few of the $changingRoomGender look confused. Someone calls you a freak, while another asks an invasive question about your body. Before the argument can grow, one of them rolls their eyes.
	<br><br>
	"Whatever. They're here to get changed, not stare at us." The crowd reluctantly parts. They may not understand, but <span class="green">they let you use the changing room</span>. <<stress 2>><<gstress>>
	<<set $schoolrep.transgender to _roomGender>>
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>><<endevent>>
